12. Algorithm 5: Frozen Heritability Evaluation

Input: Genome G_X, trait T, held-out tasks X_{\text{test}}.

Output: T(X_0), the trait value of the frozen descendant.

```
Algorithm 5: Frozen Heritability Evaluation
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Require: Genome G_X, trait T, held-out tasks X_test
Ensure: T(X_0)

1:  // Instantiate WITHOUT learning
2:  X_0 ← Instantiate(G_X)
3:  FreezeLearning(X_0)

4:  // Evaluate on held-out tasks
5:  T_0 ← EvaluateTrait(X_0, T, X_test)

6:  return T_0
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
```

Critical constraint: X_0 must be evaluated before any G_L-driven update. This isolates germline inheritance from developmental convergence.

