13. Algorithm 6: Matched Germline Substitution

Input: Parents A, B, recombination operator \mathcal{R}, trait T, sample size N.

Output: H_0(T) with confidence interval.

```
Algorithm 6: Matched Germline Substitution
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Require: Parents A, B, operator R, trait T, N
Ensure: H_0(T) with CI

1:  // Fixed stochastic background
2:  ξ ← FixedRandomness()
3:  mutation_A ← FixedMutations(A)
4:  mutation_B ← FixedMutations(B)
5:  dev_seed ← FixedSeed()

6:  // Treatment: both parents
7:  T_treatment ← []
8:  for i = 1 to N do
9:      G_X ← R(A, B, ξ, mutation_A, mutation_B, dev_seed)
10:     T_treatment.append(FrozenEval(G_X, T))

11: // Control: substitute one parent with random germline
12: T_control ← []
13: for i = 1 to N do
14:     A_random ← RandomGermline(complexity(A))
15:     G_C ← R(A_random, B, ξ, mutation_A, mutation_B, dev_seed)
16:     T_control.append(FrozenEval(G_C, T))

17: // Compute causal effect
18: H_0 ← mean(T_treatment) - mean(T_control)
19: CI ← BootstrapCI(T_treatment, T_control)
20: return H_0, CI
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
```

