15. Algorithm 8: Extractor-Blind Control

Input: Agent A, target trait T, extraction criteria \mathcal{C}_{\text{ext}}.

Output: MTCU c_{\text{blind}} from randomly parameterized extractor.

```
Algorithm 8: Extractor-Blind Control
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Require: Agent A, trait T, extraction criteria C_ext
Ensure: MTCU c_blind

1:  // Randomly parameterize extractor
2:  C_ext_random ← RandomizeParameters(C_ext)

3:  // Apply same extraction procedure with random parameters
4:  G_comp ← ComputationalGraph(A)
5:  P_random ← SpectralClustering(G_comp, C_ext_random.distance_metric)
6:  candidates ← ∅
7:  for each cluster C_i ∈ P_random do
8:      c_i ← BuildMTCU(C_i, C_ext_random.interface_spec)
9:      if Valid(c_i, T) then
10:         candidates ← candidates ∪ {c_i}
11:     end if
12: end for

13: // Select unit of comparable size/complexity to real extraction
14: c_blind ← argmin_{c_i} ||c_i| - |Extract(A, T, C_ext)||

15: return c_blind
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
```

Purpose: If offspring from c_{\text{blind}} also show apparent inheritance, the result is an extractor artifact.

